=Create a concise weekly newsletter from the source items below. Group the summary by source, state the main takeaways as clear bullets, and include the source title and its exact link for each item you reference. Do not invent facts or URLs. If an item is sparse, summarize only what is present.

Items published in the last 7 days:
{{ $json.items.map(i => [i.source ?? "Unknown source", i.publishedAt ?? "", i.title ?? "Untitled", i.content ?? "", i.link ?? ""].filter(Boolean).join(" | ")).join("\n") }}

